   </p>
   <p class="step" id="step-33" style="display: none;">
                      <!-- "step-33" -->
Here is a simple chart of the ten digits { 0 -9 }
<br><br>
This is the *wildcard representation of numbers. 
<br><br>
The even digits { 0 , 2 , 4 , 6 , 8 } are painted in yellow. The odds in green.
<br><br>
<br><br>
<br><br>
