   <p class="step" id="step-35" style="display: none;">
                    <!--   "step-35" -->
Next , move the five (*5) next to the evens.
<br><br>
<br><br>
<br><br>
   </p>
   <p class="step" id="step-36" style="display: none;">
                      <!-- "step-36" -->
Paint the *5 yellow to eliminate it.
